  "description": "Do gods play dice with the fate of entire cities? \n\nYul Choi’s city is suddenly transported to become a piece in a board game of the gods. Just when Yul thinks he can work together with people to overcome the monsters and challenges, he realizes he must become the city’s greatest villain to save the city. Can Yul rise to the demanding task of becoming the greatest and most villainous hero his city has ever seen? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
